<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p>What are you afraid of?</p>
<p>Whatever it is, it's here&#8230; in this station.</p>
<p>That and things your little rational mind couldn't even dream of.</p>
<p>But I dream.</p>
<p>Oh, I dream.</p>
<p>-<em>Hellraiser</em></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<p>A collaborative effort between myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1563840998" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;">Croquembouche</a></span> about something that should've stayed buried.</p>
<p>Thanks to everyone else who gave this one a look over in chat.</p>
<p>Image is from <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/38446022@N00/4007497950">here.</a></p>
<p>Thanks to C-Dives for the new image suggestion!</p>

